@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = cole_o_token_aqui
@companyId = 1
@machineId = 1
@photoId = 1

# Chamadas com Authorization: Bearer nao precisam CSRF.
# Se usar a sessao web do navegador em POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE, envie X-CSRF-Token.
# A API retorna X-RateLimit-Limit, X-RateLimit-Remaining e X-RateLimit-Reset.
# Ao exceder o limite, retorna 429 com Retry-After.

### API index
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Device types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/device-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List companies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies?active_only=true&page=1&per_page=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create company
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa API Teste",
  "tag_pattern": "API-0001",
  "is_active": true
}

### Get company
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update company
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tag_pattern": "API-0002"
}

### Deactivate company
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List company machines
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/machines?page=1&per_page=25&status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create machine
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/machines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_type": "outros",
  "tag": "API-001",
  "computer_model": "Equipamento generico",
  "notes": "Criado via API"
}

### Get machine
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines/{{machineId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update machine (admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines/{{machineId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "computer_model": "Equipamento atualizado",
  "notes": "Atualizado via API"
}

### Deactivate machine (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines/{{machineId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List machine photos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines/{{machineId}}/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload machine photos
# Ajuste os caminhos locais dos arquivos antes de enviar.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines/{{machineId}}/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos[]"; filename="foto-geral.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto-geral.jpg
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="network_photo[]"; filename="configuracao-rede.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./configuracao-rede.png
--boundary--

### Delete machine photo (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machine-photos/{{photoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
